step	38	-	Quick guide step 38
line	<str>Talk to King Lathas on the uk=1 of Ardougne Castle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Koftik in the westernmost part of West Ardougne next to the cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave and run south at the first junction.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Koftik for a cloth. Use it on an arrow, then use your tinderbox on it or use the arrow on the fire on the ground.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north to the gated area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip your bow and fire arrow (be sure to light the arrow with your tinderbox), then shoot the guide rope attached to the bridge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Once across the bridge, take the plank in the north room (if you did not bring one).</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue through the cave until you reach a section with water and a pit. Ignore the water, use a rope on the rock above the pit. If you fail, you will lose your rope.</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue through the cave until you reach a large grid.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk across the grid and use trial and error to find your path. You will fall through some of the tiles. Some paths are not possible, see the full guide for solving this optimally.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the lever next to the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>You can now pray Rapid Heal for the duration of this step (there is an altar up ahead). Run west past the zombie camp, there will be five sets of odd markings along the walls of the corridor (You must attempt to disable the wall traps or walk past them).</str>
line	
line	<str>You will reach an altar, take the north path using the plank on the flat rocks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the orb and walk back to the altar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the north-west path with the ogres and blessed spiders. Take the orb.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the centre-most west path, traversing the flat rocks using the plank. Take the orb.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the final path, do not pick up the orb, but search the rock beneath instead and disarm the trap to get the orb.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the zombie camp to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the 4 orbs on the furnace.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the altar, turn off Rapid Heal/pray at altar and climb down the well.</str>
line	
line	<str>Optional: Search the two stacked crates in the room you landed in to find 2 salmon and 2 meat pies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west and picklock the south-east slave cage gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your spade on the loose mud at (2).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west and cross the ledge at (3).</str>
line	
line	<str>If you have 50 thieving, take the short cut at (5) - avoid the bubbles!</str>
line	
line	<str>If you lack 50 thieving, cross the stone bridge maze to get to the other side. (4)</str>
line	
line	<str>Squeeze-through the pipe at (6).</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the unicorn cage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk through the path south of the cage and use the piece of railing on the boulder above the unicorn.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cage again to get the Unicorn horn. You can drop the piece of railing.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pass-through the tunnel and follow the cave until you reach the 3 knights.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill them and take their badges.</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue forward, using your plank on either flat rock, until you see a well.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the badges and unicorn horn on the well.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run south as far as you can (see map), and descend into the cave (yellow dot on map).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Niloof the dwarf, you will also receive 2 meat pies and a meat pizza.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Klank</col> the dwarf. (Make sure to have one inventory slot available to receive his gauntlets.)</col>
